APPENDIX: SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE AND THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

1. APPLICATION CODE

   The MIT grant above applies to the application source code in this
   repository: the Next.js application, tRPC routers, Prisma schema, agent
   framework, workers, UI components, and utility libraries.

2. TARIFF DATASET (src/hs-code-data.ts)

   The tariff dataset is a curated compilation. Its underlying facts are drawn
   from public and government-published sources:

     - WCO Harmonized System 2022 nomenclature (World Customs Organization)
     - Malaysia Customs Duties Order 2022 and amendments (Federal Gazette)
     - Malaysia Excise Duties Order and amendments (Federal Gazette)
     - Malaysia Sales Tax Act 2018 and associated Orders
     - Customs (Prohibition of Imports) Order 2023 and amendments
     - MITI Free Trade Agreement tariff schedules
     - Royal Malaysian Customs Department HS Explorer publications

   Those underlying facts are not subject to copyright. The selection,
   arrangement, annotation, TypeScript representation, and helper functions in
   this repository are copyright <kurnia-kadir.xyz> <chemmara.xyz> and are licensed under
   the MIT terms above.

   Users of this dataset are solely responsible for verifying every rate,
   flag, and classification against the current primary source before relying
   on it. See the disclaimer at the top of src/hs-code-data.ts and the
   regulatory-accuracy section of SECURITY.md.

