The Software is a tool for preparing and auditing customs documentation. It
is not a customs ruling, a legal opinion, or a substitute for professional
advice. The authors and copyright holders make no representation that any
rate, classification, control flag, or calculation produced by the Software
complies with the Customs Act 1967, the Sales Tax Act 2018, the Excise Act
1976, or any other law. You are solely responsible for the accuracy of any
declaration you file.